WEBVTT

00:17:28.048 --> 00:17:31.066
It's too late.

00:17:31.066 --> 00:17:34.367
Because I already am all of those things.

00:17:34.367 --> 00:17:38.732
We already are all of those things, and we always have been.

00:17:38.732 --> 00:17:41.538
So please don't greet us as strangers,

00:17:41.538 --> 00:17:45.091
greet us as your fellow human beings, period.

00:17:45.091 --> 00:17:46.407
Thank you.

00:17:46.407 --> 00:17:57.334
(Applause)